              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घोषयति — ghoṣayati — \"announces\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अधिकारी उच्चैः घोषयति। adhikārī uccaiḥ ghoṣayati. The official announces it loudly."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): सः उच्चैः घोषितवान्, saḥ uccaiḥ ghoṣitavān."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घोषयति (ghoṣayati) comes from the root √ghuṣ, \"to sound, cry aloud, announce publicly\"; ghoṣayati is its causative (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
